  "description": "A tropical cyclone advisory model and a reader for the US National Hurricane Center's GIS shapefile zips: the forecast track and cone ({ATCF}_5day_{adv}), the forecast wind radii ({ATCF}_fcst_{adv}) and the best track ({ATCF}_best_track). Gives the storm, the advisory, every forecast point with its intensity, class and 34/50/64 kt radii by quadrant, the cone split at 72 hours, and the past track with observed radii. Includes a small managed SHP and DBF reader for points, lines and polygons. Not for navigation. Depends on EncDotNet.S100.Core and NetTopologySuite.",
